      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Product Overview",
        "title": "Digital weight reformer and strength training system.",
        "text": "The Sensol RS02 redefines what home fitness can be. By replacing traditional spring resistance with a patent-pending digital weight system powered by dual servo motors, the RS02 delivers precise, controllable resistance from 0.5 kg all the way up to 120 kg — in increments as fine as 0.5 kg. No more swapping springs. No more guessing. Just dial in your weight and move."
      }
    },
