      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "dark",
        "image_position": "left",
        "eyebrow": "Key Feature 01",
        "title": "Digital Weight Revolution",
        "text_1": "The RS02 replaces imprecise spring resistance with a servo motor-driven digital weight system. Instead of hooking and unhooking springs to change resistance, you simply dial in your desired weight — from 0.5 kg to 120 kg — and the motor delivers it instantly. This is the same technology philosophy behind $17,000+ smart fitness systems, available at a fraction of the cost.",
        "text_2": "Traditional reformers like the Your Reformer ($2,795) and Align-Pilates F3 ($1,999) rely on 3–5 metal springs with fixed tension increments. You cannot fine-tune resistance, springs degrade over time, and switching between exercises means physically changing spring configurations. The RS02 eliminates all of this with instant, precise digital adjustment via the remote control or app."
      }
    },
