      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "light",
        "image_position": "right",
        "eyebrow": "Key Feature 02",
        "title": "Dual-Function: Reformer + Strength Trainer",
        "text_1": "The RS02 is two machines in one. The Sensol Control Dial™ lets you switch seamlessly between Pilates reformer mode and modular strength training mode. Perform footwork, hundreds, and elephant on the reformer carriage, then rotate the dial and switch to chest presses, rows, and squats using the strength arms — all without leaving the machine.",
        "text_2": "The Your Reformer ($2,795) is a Pilates reformer only. The NordicTrack Ultra 1 ($17,000+) is a strength trainer only. The RS02 is the only machine in its price range that does both, saving you the cost and space of two separate pieces of equipment."
      }
    },
