      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "dark",
        "image_position": "left",
        "eyebrow": "Key Feature 03",
        "title": "AI-Driven Coaching with Vesta Sensol App",
        "text_1": "The Vesta Sensol App (available on iOS and Android) puts a personal trainer in your pocket. With 300+ guided classes spanning Pilates, strength training, yoga, and hybrid workouts, the app tracks your performance, suggests progressions, and uses AI-driven data coaching to help you improve. The app is included free — no monthly subscription required.",
        "text_2": "The Align-Pilates F3 ($1,999) has no app connectivity whatsoever. The NordicTrack Ultra 1 requires a paid iFIT membership at approximately $60/month. The Frame Fitness system charges $39.99/month. The RS02 includes full app access with no ongoing fees — saving you up to $720 per year."
      }
    },
