        "color_scheme": "light",
        "image_position": "right",
        "eyebrow": "Key Feature 04",
        "title": "Compact Footprint — 0.2 m² When Stored",
        "text_1": "Australian homes are not getting bigger, but your fitness should not be limited by floor space. The RS02 stores upright in just 0.2 square metres — roughly the footprint of a small chair. Fold it up after your workout and tuck it against a wall, in a cupboard, or beside the bed. The 13 cm ground clearance keeps it stable during use while maintaining a low, accessible profile.",
        "text_2": "Traditional reformers like the Align-Pilates F3 require a dedicated room — they are 1.8+ metres long and cannot be stored vertically. The Your Reformer offers a foldable option but still occupies significant floor space. The RS02's vertical storage is unique in the smart fitness category, and its noiseless motor design eliminates the squeaking and clanging of spring reformers."
      }
    },
