    "sp_reviews": {
      "type": "sensol-reviews",
      "blocks": {
        "review_1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "text": "I was spending $220 a month on reformer Pilates classes and honestly, I was getting tired of the scheduling hassle. The RS02 has completely replaced my studio membership. The digital weight is a game-changer — being able to adjust resistance in 0.5 kg increments means I can actually track my progress properly. The app classes are excellent and I love that I can switch to strength training without needing a separate bench. Paid for itself in 9 months.",
            "name": "Emma R.",
            "role": "Sydney, NSW"
          }
        },
        "review_2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "text": "I live in a one-bedroom apartment in Melbourne and honestly did not think I could fit a reformer. The RS02 stores upright against my bedroom wall and takes up almost no space. The noiseless motor is incredible — my partner sleeps through my 6 AM workouts. Setup took 20 minutes. The app is intuitive and the classes are genuinely challenging. Best $2,000 I have spent on fitness.",
            "name": "James L.",
            "role": "Melbourne, VIC"
          }
        },
        "review_3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "text": "After a lower back injury, my physio recommended Pilates. Private sessions were $120 each and adding up fast. The RS02's Constant mode and 0.5 kg increments let me progress at exactly the right pace. Eight weeks in and my pain is significantly reduced. My physio is impressed with the progress. Having this at home means I can do my exercises every day without the cost and travel of clinic visits.",
            "name": "Sarah K.",
            "role": "Brisbane, QLD"
          }
        },
        "review_4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "text": "I backed the Indiegogo campaign and have been using the RS02 for three months. The digital weight system is brilliant — instant changes, no spring swapping. The Control Dial is satisfying to use and the app integration is seamless. Knocked off one star because I would love to see more advanced classes added to the app, but they are updating regularly. For the price, nothing else comes close.",
            "name": "David T.",
            "role": "Perth, WA"
          }
        }
      },
